# Demo video pipeline scratch space: rendered clips and TTS (work/, out/), raw
# screenshots of a running app (frames/) and downloaded voice models. These are
# inputs and outputs of scripts/demo-video, never sources — and frames/ can hold
# real inbox data, so it must never be committed.
scripts/demo-video/work/
scripts/demo-video/out/
scripts/demo-video/frames/
scripts/demo-video/models/
